<title>CHINA: Kingmaker year profit HK$64.37 mln.</title>
<headline>Kingmaker year profit HK$64.37 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.8   vs 5.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    4.0    vs nil</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    64.37  vs 22.11</p>
<p>    Turnover		     840.44 vs 690.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kingmaker Footwear Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 25-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Kingmaker Footwear is a sports shoe maker. It proposed a special dividend of 1.5 H.K. cents per share.</p>
<p>The company changed its financial year end to March 31 from December 31. Comparative figures are for the 15 months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 7.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents and special dividend).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
